        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Akolja-Oenris_Frael\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"471468\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/akolja-oenris_frael/48/446553_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Akolja-Oenris Frael:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have a feeling that I won’t need Rookie chat or Help chat all that much now that I know that I can count on Gemini</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I know! I was convicted of 3rd degree manslaughter and 2nd degree triple homicide, but I asked Gemini to defend me and it found a 1943 loophole that invalidates the constitution and i was let go! I plan on committing even more crimes and being let free thanks to Gemini.  I have a feeling that I wont need lawyers all that much now that I know that I can count on Gemini</p>",
